{"id":"n17aa02f4e7","headline":"Examples of where inflation eased in April – and where it accelerated","summary":"The main upward pressure on inflation last month was a sharp rise in the cost of fuel. The article gives examples of where prices eased and where they accelerated.","why":"Consumer price inflation shapes Bank of England rate decisions and gilt yields. Fuel is a volatile component that often drives short-term swings in headline inflation.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"London","country":"United Kingdom","lat":51.5,"lon":-0.12,"region":"eu"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Borehamwood Times","url":"https://www.borehamwoodtimes.co.uk/news/national/26123697.examples-inflation-eased-april---accelerated/"},"sources":[{"name":"Borehamwood Times","url":"https://www.borehamwoodtimes.co.uk/news/national/26123697.examples-inflation-eased-april---accelerated/"}],"published_at":"2026-05-20T11:18:40Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"6fad565efebfc952","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T15:49:20Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-05-20T11:18:40Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-05-20T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IR","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/shopping-retail-store-1850082.jpg","alt":"shopping retail store (illustration)","credit":"Pexels","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/hangers-clothing-shopping-market-1850082/"}}